    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρείων</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span> gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, used as 
